Subject: Include cstdint for isolated-vm timer integer types

Origin: DHI-internal (Directus package build)
Description: isolated-vm 7.0.1 uses uint32_t in timer.h without directly including cstdint.
Base-Tree: tarball https://registry.npmjs.org/isolated-vm/-/isolated-vm-7.0.1.tgz sha256:d0e95ca72f0d14443af16089225296e5137628ecd68898feb0a97cebcb02ca32
Verify: cmd `dhi def build --fast package/main/directus/alpine-3.24/12.yaml` expect "Successfully built"
Forwarded: no (the package applies this build compatibility include)
Drop-When: never: remove when isolated-vm directly includes cstdint or stops using uint32_t

GCC 15 no longer exposes uint32_t transitively while compiling isolated-vm from source, so the Directus package build adds the standard header that declares the type.

--- a/src/lib/timer.h
+++ b/src/lib/timer.h
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 #pragma once
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <memory>
 #include <functional>
 
